g1046_npc_elder_13571=Leave the gift to others, there will be better gifts on 1st January
g1046_npc_fishing_master_10331= \\nFishing helps to reduce anxiety, fight off depression and brings you peace. It takes your mind off the troubles. Now, how about some fishing?
g1046_npc_fishing_master_10332= \\nBefore all else, you must first make sure you're at the correct fishing position, that is, the place where the wooden sign is located. Click on it when you are nearby to start fishing.
g1046_npc_fishing_master_10333= \\nFirst of all, choose a suitable angle, then drop the fishing rod. Observe the water surface, and wait patiently
g1046_npc_fishing_master_10334= \\nWhen the fish takes the bait, a progress bar will appear on the interface. If you let the progress drop to zero, the fish will be gone.
g1046_npc_fishing_master_10335= \\nIf you take too long reeling in the rod, the fish will also slip away, so hurry up!
g1046_npc_fishing_master_10336= \\nWhen the progress bar reaches the upper limit, the fish is hooked and at your control. You can then successfully take the fish.
g1046_npc_fishing_merchant_10111=Fishing administrator
g1046_npc_fishing_merchant_10131= \\nHello. I am the person in charge of this fishing spot. During the event, the fishing spot is open to public for free!
g1046_npc_fishing_merchant_10132= \\nThere are a lot of sites to fish here. See those wooden signs? They shall guide you!
g1046_npc_fishing_merchant_10133= \\nNo matter how many fish you have, I'll take them all. I assure you that the rewards will be huge.
g1046_npc_fishing_merchant_10134= \\nIf you don't know how to fish, ask the Fishing Master for some advice. He's the best of the best!
g1046_npc_pilot_13871=Hey there! Do you want to try our new circus project: Glass Bridge Plus. As long as you clear the game, you can get the gift I've prepared. (Complete to get a chance to draw one of 3 gifts. Up to 3 draws are available every day)
