gui.check.in.back.rule=1. Sign-in points can be obtained by signing in every day and completing daily active point rewards. \\n \\n2. The sign-in points will be automatically used to accumulate the progress of the Customized Reward Box. After the progress is reached, you can freely choose any reward in the treasure box. \\n \\n3. After players who have been offline for more than 60 days return to the game, they can receive the "Returning Player" active task points bonus, which lasts for 14 days. \\n \\n4. Each account of the advanced Customized Reward Box can only receive it once, and points must be accumulated within 90 days after receiving it. \\n \\n5. The advanced Customized Reward Box will disappear after the player successfully collects it or after the natural time exceeds 90 days. \\n \\n6. When the player successfully receives the gift package of his choice, the active points bonus for returning players will be cleared.
