gui.peak.mode.details=1. Only players in the Dragon Hunter rank can participate.\\n\\n2. Solo game mode.\\n\\n3. Each season lasts 4 weeks: the first 3 weeks are for competition, and the 4th week is for statistics and awards.\\n\\n4. Matchmaking is available on Friday, Saturday, and Sunday during the competition week.\\n\\n5. Each season is calculated as a unit of 10 games. Based on the results of the 10 games, the highest score of the period is calculated and ranked.\\n\\n· Ranking score (1-8): 45 - 35 - 25 - 15 - 10 - 5 - 3 - 2\\n\\n· Successfully eliminated the enemy score: 5-20\\n\\n· Successfully destroyed the bed score: 3\\n\\n6. Runes, talents, and pets are allowed in battle, but props brought in from outside the game cannot be used.\\n\\n7. During the battle, the chat function will be closed and the player's name will be hidden.\\n\\n8. Some talents and runes will be randomly disabled each season, please pay attention to the disabled list each period.\\n\\n9. In the middle of every 10 games, you can choose to stop the current round and recalculate the results.\\n\\n10. The top 3 players in each season will build their Summit Game NPC in the lobby to show their strength.\\n\\n
