common.activity.desc.10001=\\n1.Consume steps to swipe the sheep blocks left and right. When a row of sheep blocks is filled, clear and collect the sheep.\\n 2.When steps are less than 12, 1 stamina will be restored every 2 hours.\\n3.If the collected sheep contain a sheepdog, the adjacent sheep and the sheepdog will also be collected.\\n4.If the collected sheep contain a gift box, a random reward from the gift box will be obtained when the sheep blocks stop moving.\\n5.The four colors of sheep collected can be exchanged for various rewards in the exchange store.\\n6.At the end of the event, the remaining sheep and steps will not be retained.
