common.activity.tab.9096_1=Brick Breaker
common.activity.desc.9096=1.Use flying swords to participate in the brick-breaking activity. Click the left and right buttons to move the paddle.\\n2.After launching the flying sword, it will fly out at a random angle. It will bounce off edges and the paddle. If it falls to the bottom, you will lose it.\\n3.Break reward blocks to get the rewards inside. You can preview the rewards for all levels.\\n4.Daily active tasks refresh. Complete tasks to earn flying swords, or buy them directly with golden cubes. You can also get a flying sword by watching an ad every 24 hours.\\n5.Hitting a lucky block will randomly grant effects: lengthen or shorten the paddle, speed up or slow down the paddle, or speed up or slow down the flying sword.\\n6.Hitting a skull block will devour the flying sword.\\n7.Use the refresh button to reset the level, or use the upgrade button to skip the level.
