snatch.treasure.info.title=“Wolf Attack”
snatch.treasure.info.text=Relic Scout (5-8 Players):\\n1. Spawn on the Furnace Isle. Use campfires to activate the furnace and continuously obtain gold ingots.\\n2. Gather resources, purchase equipment and items, and evade the Predator Wolf.\\n3. Survive for 10 minutes to achieve victory.\\n\\nPredator Wolf (1-2 Players):\\n1. Spawn on the central Treasure Isle with initial stat advantages.\\n2. Control the central area and open chests to obtain emeralds and items.\\n3. Locate and eliminate all Relic Scouts before the 10-minute timer ends to achieve victory.\\n\\nTips:\\n• Player names are not visible through walls to enemies.\\n• Relic Scouts cannot respawn via beds, while Predator Wolves have unlimited respawns.\\n• Different roles have access to different item shops.\\n• Victorious surviving players receive higher ranking rewards.
